<title>HONG KONG: Sino Land said buyer of Chai Wan site.</title>
<headline>Sino Land said buyer of Chai Wan site.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Developer Sino Land Co Ltd was the successful bidder for the large site in Chai Wan, on eastern Hong Kong island, sold at a Hong Kong government land auction on Tuesday, industry sources said.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The 25,592 sq m plot, zoned for non-industrial usage, sold for HK$11.82 billion after drawn out bidding lasting for more than two hours.</p>
<p>Industry analysts had forecast the site would realise between HK$6.0 billion to $14.8 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 284</p>
